[Options]

[A.]
<h2>~lHelp to your friend</h2>
<i>"If you help to your friend he will help to you too"<br>
--Theory of friendship</i>
<p>You got the letter from your old friend Munder:<br>
Dear Sunder!<br>
Mighty Evil King begin to attack me. I am the peaceful Nimbian and can't fight against those invaders. Can you take control of my soldiers and help me?<br>
--~jSincerely yours, Munder<br>
~wIt seems Munder have many money to fight against Invaders of Evil King, so do you want to help him?
$Button=Its too hard for me!,Tell,Campaign
$Button=Yes,DoNothing,0
$Button=No,Tell,no

[Succeeded] [BadTeamDead]

<h2>~lCongratulations!</h2>
<i>~E"I was more happier, when I win second time"<br>
--Sunder</i>
<p>~EYou helped to your old friend Munder! Here is the letter recieved from him:<br>

Dear Sunder!<br>
Thank you very much. You save me! My lands now free from invaders of Evil King. I hate him, so I found general who will help you in the next battles. His name is Klod Jandor. I hope he will be useful. Also I will help you with moneys. Good luck<br>
--~jSincerely yours, Munder<br>
~wYou thought: his general Klod Jandor will be helpful. Now you will attack a frontier of Evil King's kingdom.

<$Config,Done{mission.fileName}=1>
<$Config,Donesh3_1a=0>
<$Config,Donesh3_2b=1>
<$Config,Help=1>
$Button=Its too hard for me!,Tell,Campaign
$Button=Proceed,MissionBegin,sh3_y_1

[@1]

<h2>~lIncoming Message</h2>
<i>~jFrom: ~qMunder<br>
~jTo: ~qSunder</i>
<p>Thank you for choosing to help me. Good luck!

$Button=Accept,DoNothing,0
$Button=Check your Knowledge,ShowTechnology,55

[Failed]
<h2>~lYou lose...</h2>
<p>Don't worry if you lose, this is Shit Hard!

$Button=Its too hard for me!,Tell,Campaign
$Button=Try again!,Tell,TryAgain
$Button=No I dont want to help,Tell,no

[no]
